{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02570","headline":"咏鹦鹉 · 李义府","name":"咏鹦鹉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牵弋辞重海，触网去层峦。\n戢翼雕笼际，延思彩霞端。\n慕侣朝声切，离羣夜影寒。\n能言殊可贵，相助忆长安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李义府","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02570.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02570","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}